From b081bb75389e7548718fe9b5d0735c28a4f5b51a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: flex-build <build@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:39:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] audio: a filter that lets a callback change the samples

Flex's patch: af_flexsound hands the audio passing through to a callback as interleaved floats, which changes it in place, and tells a second callback when the filter is cleared on seeks. Set them with mpv_flex_set_sound.
---
 audio/filter/af_flexsound.c | 119 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 filters/user_filters.c      |   1 +
 filters/user_filters.h      |   1 +
 include/mpv/client.h        |  15 +++++
 meson.build                 |   1 +
 5 files changed, 137 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 audio/filter/af_flexsound.c

diff --git a/audio/filter/af_flexsound.c b/audio/filter/af_flexsound.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..537b7f4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/audio/filter/af_flexsound.c
@@ -0,0 +1,119 @@
